# size 10x4
# Autowrap off: the last column overwrites itself instead of moving to the next line.
#
# htop and nano both send CSI ?7 h on the way in, so the mode was reaching this emulator and being
# dropped - which only ever agreed with a terminal because the value they set is the default. This
# is the other direction, which nothing on this machine sends and which would therefore have gone
# on being wrong indefinitely.
\e[?7labcdefghijklmn
\r\n\e[?7habcdefghijklmn
